<title>SRI LANKA: Haycarb full-year month net flat.</title>
<headline>Haycarb full-year month net flat.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Haycarb Ltd, for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				   1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,172.40     vs    945.74</p>
<p>    Net profit		 149.05     vs    148.75</p>
<p>    Tax			   36.78     vs     27.43</p>
<p>NOTE - Haycarb Ltd manufactures activated carbon for export. The firm is a unit of blue chip Hayleys Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
